          "name": "Order attachment upload",
          "request": {
            "name": "Order attachment upload",
            "description": {
              "content": "Order attachments sent to this endpoint will be uploaded to the marketplace and linked to the specified order (items). A 202 status response indicates the file has been processed and will be uploaded asynchronously.\n\nCurrently only accepts PDF invoices.\n\nAvailable for:\n - ANWB\n- Allegro\n- Amazon\n- Bol\n- Boulanger\n- But\n- Carrefour\n- Carrefour France\n- Castorama\n- Channable Sandbox\n- Conforama\n- Conrad\n- Debenhams\n- Decathlon\n- Douglas\n- Galeries LaFayette\n- Home24\n- Hornbach\n- Inno\n- Kaufland\n- Kruidvat\n- La Redoute\n- Le BHV Marais\n- Leen Bakker\n- Leroy Merlin\n- Maisons Du Monde\n- Manor\n- Maxeda Brico\n- Maxeda Praxis\n- MediaMarkt\n- Nextail\n- Nocibe\n- Obelink\n- Pc Componentes\n- Shop Apotheke Austria\n- Shop Apotheke Belgium\n- Shop Apotheke Germany\n- Shop Apotheke Italy\n- Showroomprive\n- Sprinter\n- Teract\n- Worten\n- ePrice\n- fonQ\n- vtwonen",
